   "parent": null,
   "text": "Management:",
   "bbox": [
    51.2,
    167.8,
    107.0,
    178.9
   ],
   "key": "p11-faa4fbd1"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-rb1-e23",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "management",
   "section": "Management:",
   "section_y": 167.8,
   "indent": 1,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Check and record BP, pulse, respiratory rate and temperature and ensure patient is urgently seen by nurse or doctor.",
   "bbox": [
    51.2,
    178.1,
    498.4,
    188.9
   ],
   "key": "p11-e1c61025"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-rb1-e24",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 1,
   "kind_hint": "management",
   "section": "Management:",
   "section_y": 167.8,
   "indent": 1,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "If decreased consciousness, seizures, confused, unable to sit up or known diabetic, also check glucose.",
   "bbox": [
    51.2,
    188.1,
    445.7,
    198.9
   ],
   "key": "p11-bb99c108"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-out-e01",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "INITIAL ASSESSMENT OF THE PATIENT",
   "bbox": [
    266.1,
    48.8,
    575.8,
    71.1
   ],
   "key": "p11-958f79ed"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-out-e02",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Do routine tests on the patient not needing urgent attention • Routinely check and record weight, BP, pulse and temperature. • If coughing/difficulty breathing, also check respiratory rate and oxygen saturation, if available.",
   "bbox": [
    246.6,
    220.6,
    595.1,
    251.8
   ],
   "key": "p11-a790b9a0"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-out-e03",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Ensure the patient with any of the following is seen promptly by nurse or doctor • BP ≥ 180/110 or systolic BP < 80 • Pregnant with BP ≥ 140/90 • Pulse irregular, ≥ 100 or < 50 • Temperature ≥ 38°C • Respiratory rate ≥ 30 • Glucose < 3 (or < 4 if diabetic) or ≥ 11.1 • Oxygen saturation < 92% at rest • Oxygen saturation drop to < 87% on exertion (walking 15-20m)",
   "bbox": [
    69.4,
    266.1,
    774.3,
    297.5
   ],
   "key": "p11-b631e487"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-out-e04",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Continue to assess the pregnant patient and the patient with hypertension and/or diabetes",
   "bbox": [
    239.5,
    311.8,
    602.3,
    323.0
   ],
   "key": "p11-4816d4d5"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-out-e05",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Patient has hypertension",
   "bbox": [
    400.6,
    338.2,
    491.6,
    348.4
   ],
   "key": "p11-6ba8aa91"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-out-e06",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Check at every visit: • Weight • BP",
   "bbox": [
    359.3,
    362.7,
    438.6,
    393.9
   ],
   "key": "p11-35801489"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-out-e07",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Check once a year: • BMI1, waist circumference (also check 3-6 monthly if trying to lose weight) • Urine dipstick • Fingerprick glucose (also check if glucose on urine dipstick)",
   "bbox": [
    359.3,
    398.4,
    530.3,
    459.6
   ],
   "key": "p11-827c2beb"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-out-e08",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Patient has diabetes",
   "bbox": [
    647.8,
    338.2,
    721.3,
    348.4
   ],
   "key": "p11-d52a11f3"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-out-e09",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Check at every visit: • BP • Fingerprick glucose • Urine dipstick only if fingerprick glucose ≥ 11.1",
   "bbox": [
    589.6,
    362.7,
    766.8,
    403.9
   ],
   "key": "p11-b1cbcc67"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-out-e10",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Check once a year: • BMI1, waist circumference, waist-hip ratio3 (also check 3-6 monthly if trying to lose weight) • Urine dipstick • Visual acuity",
   "bbox": [
    589.6,
    408.4,
    768.7,
    459.5
   ],
   "key": "p11-1ab08e88"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-out-e11",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Patient is pregnant",
   "bbox": [
    146.6,
    338.2,
    215.6,
    348.4
   ],
   "key": "p11-7e88cc6d"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-out-e12",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Check at booking visit: • Mid Upper Arm Circumference (MUAC) • Weight and height to calculate BMI1 • Fingerprick glucose only if risk factor2 • Hb • Rapid rhesus and syphilis • Urine dipstick",
   "bbox": [
    51.0,
    362.7,
    199.4,
    433.9
   ],
   "key": "p11-515cb243"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-out-e13",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "Check at every visit: • BP • Urine dipstick • Fingerprick glucose only if glucose on urine dipstick on ≥ 2 occasions • HIV and syphilis Also: • At 26 weeks: fingerprick glucose only if risk factor2 • At 30 and 36 weeks: Hb",
   "bbox": [
    51.0,
    438.4,
    309.9,
    519.5
   ],
   "key": "p11-69d6ac3c"
  },
  {
   "id": "p11-out-e14",
   "page": 11,
   "box": 0,
   "kind_hint": "outside",
   "section": null,
   "section_y": -1,
   "indent": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "1BMI = weight (kg) ÷ height (m) ÷ height (m). 2Glucose in urine, BMI ≥ 35, age ≥ 40 years, previous diabetes in pregnancy, first degree family history of diabetes (parents, siblings), previous unexplained stillbirth, previous baby with congenital abnormalities, previous baby ≥ 4000g, polyhydramnios, SFH large for gestational age, Indian ethnicity. 3Waist-hip ratio = waist circumference ÷ hip circumference (measure at the widest part of the hips/buttocks).",
   "bbox": [
    34.0,
    535.3,
    768.2,
    551.8
   ],
   "key": "p11-8f7d6f08"
  }
 ]
}